    "title": "Billboards for tech firm appear in Youngstown, sparking questions and speculation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Madison Tromler ,\n5 hours ago At least two billboards for a controversial technology company have suddenly appeared in Youngstown, prompting questions about why the company is targeting the area and what it could mean. The signs advertise Palantir Technologies, a U.S.-based international data analytics company known for working with government agencies, including Immigration and Customs... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
